{"html_text": {"ja233:0.1": "<article id='ja233'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja233:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja233:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja233:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja233:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja233:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja233:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja233:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja233:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja233:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja233:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja233:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja233:3.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja233:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja233:0.2": "Dukanipāta ", "ja233:0.3": "Upāhanavagga ", "ja233:0.4": "3. Vikaṇṇajātaka ", "ja233:1.1": "“Kāmaṁ yahiṁ icchasi tena gaccha, ", "ja233:1.2": "Viddhosi mammamhi vikaṇṇakena; ", "ja233:1.3": "Hatosi bhattena suvāditena, ", "ja233:1.4": "Lolo ca macche anubandhamāno”. ", "ja233:2.1": "“Evampi lokāmisaṁ opatanto, ", "ja233:2.2": "Vihaññatī cittavasānuvattī; ", "ja233:2.3": "So haññatī ñātisakhāna majjhe, ", "ja233:2.4": "Macchānugo soriva suṁsumāro”ti. ", "ja233:3.1": "Vikaṇṇajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja233:0.1": "", "ja233:0.2": "", "ja233:0.3": "", "ja233:0.4": "", "ja233:1.1": "", "ja233:1.2": "mammamhi → mamasmi (mr) ", "ja233:1.3": "suvāditena → savāditena (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja233:1.4": "", "ja233:2.1": "", "ja233:2.2": "", "ja233:2.3": "", "ja233:2.4": "soriva suṁsumāro”ti → susumāro (mr) ", "ja233:3.1": "Vikaṇṇajātakaṁ → vikaṇṇakajātakaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja233:0.1": "", "ja233:0.2": "", "ja233:0.3": "", "ja233:0.4": "", "ja233:1.1": "dr27.89, ms22J_608, msdiv165, pts-vp-pli2.228", "ja233:1.2": "", "ja233:1.3": "", "ja233:1.4": "", "ja233:2.1": "csp1ed22.65, csp2ed22.65, ms22J_609, msdiv166, sya27.90", "ja233:2.2": "", "ja233:2.3